# Distribution packaging.
#
# `git archive` (what GitHub's "Download ZIP" button, GitHub Releases
# source archives, and this repo's own release-zip Action all build on)
# skips anything marked export-ignore below, so the zip a parish actually
# installs only contains what the plugin needs to run — no test suite, no
# CI config, no dev-only tooling. The plugin has no runtime Composer
# dependencies (see composer.json's "require" — just a PHP version
# constraint), so none of this affects functionality.

/tests                          export-ignore
/.github                        export-ignore
/docs                            export-ignore
/images                         export-ignore
/phpunit.xml.dist                export-ignore
/phpunit-integration.xml.dist   export-ignore
/composer.json                   export-ignore
/composer.lock                   export-ignore
/README.md                       export-ignore
/.gitattributes                 export-ignore
/.gitignore                      export-ignore
